category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libestr-devel
sdesc: "Event Expression Library inspired by CEE (utilities)"
ldesc: "CEE is an upcoming standard used to describe network events in a number of
normalized formats. It's goal is to unify they currently many different
representations that exist in the industry."
